33. When making a submission to Council or to a Council Committee, a member of the
public must:
(a) speak only when called upon by the Chair;
(b) abide by the rules of conduct in section 31 and abide by the Chair’s direction
regarding participation;
(c) refrain from disclosing personal information of third parties, other than those that
the member of the public is representing;
